Brk 0 at 0012D37C

0012D37C!BPT

w/no chance at any input--ie I think it's totally hung.

Then I whittled it down, removing the scsi drives, the qlogic scsi card, and 
the video card and turned it on again.  Result:

Brk 0 at 0012D37C

0012D37C!BPT           (New IPL = 30)

